% ============================================================================
% thermobinder.sty — Production LaTeX Style for Science Olympiad 2026-2027
% Division C Thermodynamics Competition Binder & Companion Handbooks
%
% Verified offline MiKTeX 25.12 package stack (zero network / zero Type 3 fonts).
% Geometry: US Letter, twoside duplex, 0.75 in inner 3-hole punch margin,
%           0.50 in outer thumb-tab margin, 0.62 in top, 0.58 in bottom.
% Supports:
%   - \ifdefined\grayproof  -> true grayscale proof mode
%   - \ifdefined\companionmode -> standalone QuickRef (12 pp) / Device Handbook
%   - 9 Outer-Edge Thumb Tabs (CMD/QUICK .. INDEX/APP)
%   - \scopebanner{REQUIRED|TIER-DEPENDENT|SUPPLEMENTARY|VERIFY AGAINST RULES}[clause]
%   - Pedagogical boxes: formulacard, workedexample (+ \verifiedby), trapbox,
%     devicebox, rulebox, quicksheet, tierbox (+ aliases formula, quick, assume,
%     trap, labbox, shortcut, derivation, suppbox, example)
%   - 5 Named MakeIndex indices: topic, formula, figure, error, devfail
%     (\idxtopic, \idxformula, \idxfig, \idxerr, \idxdev)
% ============================================================================
